tem Types](https://help.sap.com/viewer/2c1988d620e04368aa4103bf26f17727/latest/en-US/df16fa40b3dc4ed3b86e575ad6d1198d.html) as:\n\n\n\n* Single-host system - one SAP HANA instance on one host server\n* Multi-node / distributed / scale-out cluster\n\n\n\nA single-host system is the simplest system installation type.",
